s the right-hand BStr's bytes with themselves, so unequal operands incorrectly compare equal. The fix compares those bytes with self.as_bytes(), restoring comparison between the two operands. The regression test added by the fix checks that Cow<BStr>(\"hello bstr\") differs from &BStr(\"goodbye bstr\").", "updated_at": "2026-09-23T22:43:22.473613+00:00"}
