"subject": "impl: fix replacement codepoint handling in Debug impl", "summary": "BStr debug formatting confused a valid UTF-8 replacement character (U+FFFD) with the sentinel for invalid UTF-8, printing its bytes as \\xEF\\xBF\\xBD instead of the literal character. The fix checks the original bytes and formats valid U+FFFD through escape_debug(), preserving byte escapes for invalid UTF-8. The fix adds a detecting assertion to impls::test_debug. Both proposed implementation regions occur exactly once in their respective revisions. No tests were run.", "updated_at": "2026-09-23T22:53:00.840661+00:00"}
